OL,3,GNEWSATeacher struck off for watching
OL,4,Aporn at school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former teacher at a south-east London
OL,7,Fschool has been barred from the
OL,8,Fprofession after he accessed
OL,9,Fpornography and stored sexual content
OL,10,Fon his work computer.
OL,12,FWilliam Schaper, 49, was employed as a
OL,13,Fgeneral subjects teacher at Eltham
OL,14,FCollege Junior School for more than 20
OL,15,Fyears.
OL,17,FHe initially denied the allegations and
OL,18,Fsaid he "wouldn't do this sort of
OL,19,Fthing" before he admitted watching
OL,20,Fpornography at the school, a Teaching
OL,21,FRegulation Agency (TRA) panel heard.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
